# doha-roms property_contexts additions (appended, marker-checked, by
# scripts/apply-latent-fixes.sh). Fixes BUG-REGISTER #20: legacy qcom prop
# names whose vendor prop-file writes are denied at every boot on
# Android 16 because the default labelling makes them system-owned.
#
# ril.subscription.types: qcrild reads this to configure per-slot
# subscription modes; the vendor prop file write has been silently
# failing on every boot since Android 13 on this tree family.
# persist.debug.wfd.enable: WFD (Miracast) default switch.
#
# Longest-prefix wins in property_contexts, so these exact names override
# the generic system prefixes (ril., persist.debug.).
ril.subscription.types    u:object_r:vendor_radio_prop:s0
persist.debug.wfd.enable  u:object_r:vendor_default_prop:s0
